       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SPHERE-TORQUE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SPHERE-TORQUE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FRICTION-CONE-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TORQUE-POLYTOPE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SEAT-CLEARANCE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TENSOR-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TENSOR-SEAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SPHERE-TORQUE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PST-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PST-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FRICTION-AND-POLYTOPE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CLEARANCE-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PST-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FRICTION-AND-POLYTOPE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FRICTION-CONE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TORQUE-POLYTOPE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CLEARANCE-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SEAT-CLEARANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TENSOR-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PST-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FRICTION-CONE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TORQUE-POLYTOPE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SEAT-CLEARANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TENSOR-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TENSOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PST-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PST-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PST-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PST-CODE.
